Package: com.551.replacedscreenbattery
Name: Replaced Screen & Battery
Version: 1.0.11
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Fully hides replaced screen/battery warnings and their Settings badge on iOS 15–16.
 The original Replaced tweak is a 10-line SystemHealthUI hook that removes the
 Parts and Service / Unknown Part entries from General > About. This tweak also
 removes the main display and battery message and single Settings badge, and
 includes a master switch and Respring button.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
